### =====================================================
### 2FA Enroll Verify - POST /account/2fa/enroll/verify
### Confirma el enrolamiento 2FA con el código recibido
### (email) o generado por la app (authenticator)
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Verificar enrolamiento por email (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Email",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Test 2: Verificar enrolamiento con authenticator — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Authenticator",
  "code": "654321"
}

### Test 3: Método 2FA inválido — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "sms",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Test 4: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Email",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Test 5: Campo requerido faltante (sin code) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/enroll/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Email"
}
